WEBVTT

00:04:58.335 --> 00:05:01.128
and he said, "You should think long-term."

00:05:01.152 --> 00:05:03.641
And when we asked him,
"How long-term?" he said,

00:05:03.665 --> 00:05:05.839
"Yeah, well, 200 years."

00:05:05.863 --> 00:05:08.204
So I think that is possibly
a bit too long,

00:05:08.228 --> 00:05:09.381
we don't have that time,

00:05:09.405 --> 00:05:12.103
but 10 years is a good horizon
for all of us.